OL,3,GNEWSAStoke-on-Trent UK's friendliest
OL,4,Acity? Course it is, ducky
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a city with an international
OL,7,Freputation for pottery, famed for its
OL,8,Fhistoric bottle kilns and its love of
OL,9,Foatcakes. But do the six towns that
OL,10,Fmake up Stoke-on-Trent also make it the
OL,11,Ffriendliest city in the UK?
OL,13,FNewspaper columnist Ben Aitken
OL,14,Fcertainly thinks so, after exploring
OL,15,Fthe city for his Sunday Times column.
OL,16,FHe visited attractions like Trentham
OL,17,FGardens, World of Wedgwood and the
OL,18,Fnearby New Vic - as well as sampling
OL,19,Foatcakes.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
