OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAStoke-on-Trent UK's friendliest
OL,4,Acity? Course it is, ducky
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was also called "ducky" 17 times in
OL,7,Fa single afternoon and described
OL,8,FStokies as "warm and friendly". He is
OL,9,Ffar from alone in this view.
OL,11,FLocals told BBC Radio Stoke you won't
OL,12,F"meet nicer people anywhere in the
OL,13,Fworld" - and praised the city's
OL,14,Fcommunity spirit and working-class
OL,15,Froots as the reason why.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
